# Expense Tracker (Python)

## Description
This is a console-based Python application that allows users to track their expenses.  
The program lets users add, view, update, and delete expenses.  
All data is stored in a SQLite database so it is saved even after the program is closed.

---

## Features
- Add new expenses  
- View all expenses  
- Update existing expenses  
- Delete expenses  
- Data is saved using a database (SQLite)  

---

## Technologies Used
- Python  
- SQLite (database)  
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)  

---

## How to Run
1. Open the project folder in VS Code  
2. Make sure Python is installed  
